WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.370
Blocked Drive Impact creates the corner Crush state.

2
00:00:01.370 --> 00:00:02.570
Crouching heavy punch continues the wall-splat conversion.

3
00:00:02.570 --> 00:00:04.120
Light Breathing Ring and its medium-punch follow-up continue the juggle.

4
00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:05.220
Light Arm of Justice and its continuation finish the route.

5
00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:06.420
Dhalsim lands after the final punch.
